{"id":"n59756-1-11","stage":1,"title":"봉투 · 信封","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59756-1-11-1","ko":"언니, 이게 웬 돈 봉투야?","zh":"姐姐，这个装钱的信封是怎么回事？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니,","meaning":"姐姐，大姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐，大姐","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봉투야?","meaning":"信封","explanation":"봉투：信封；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"봉투","audio":"/audio/e974d886dd5749a4dcd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59756","senseId":"1","lemma":"봉투","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐，大姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"什么，哪儿来的","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"不知道怎么回事。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":